Apply a preset and list the matching rows

Usage: mxr activity saved open [OPTIONS] <SLUG>

Arguments:
  <SLUG>

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>    [default: 50]
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
